Package: macabout
Version: 1.0.10
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libegl1, libgl1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrender1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libfontconfig1, pciutils
Recommends: fontconfig, udev
Maintainer: PandaWood <pandawoude@gmail.com>
Description: About This Computer dialog, Apple-style
 A Linux desktop app that displays a styled "About This Mac"-inspired
 dialog showing distro, machine model, processor, memory and graphics.
 Translates raw Linux hardware identifiers into clean marketing names.
